      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Two H3 Reference Turbo Realtime clips with sound, from a person and a place. Connect each image to a picture socket; prompts call them Picture 1 and Picture 2, in socket order. Every clip needs its own pictures, so both segments take both. Pictures guide how the clip looks; they aren't its first frame.\n\nH3 Reference Turbo Realtime prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/h3-reference-to-video-turbo-realtime/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
